# MEMO.C and MEMOIO.H: the memo editor's messages (MM_).
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
300 MM_HINT Ctrl-S=Save Ins=Insert Ctrl-Y=Delete-line Esc=Back F1=Help
301 MM_HINTRO Esc=Close F1=Help

302 MM_CHANGED Tabs, control bytes or long lines were changed; Ctrl-S writes them back
303 MM_TRUNC The notes were cut short by the server; shown read-only
304 MM_TOOMANY The notes have more than ^1 lines; shown read-only
305 MM_FULL The notes are full
306 MM_LINEFULL The line is full; Enter starts a new one
307 MM_PARTIAL Saving stopped after ^1 of ^2 lines; the stored notes are unchanged
308 MM_READONLY Shown read-only
309 MM_TOOLONG The notes would pass the stored limit once converted; shown read-only
310 MM_MAYBE The connection was lost as the notes were sent: they may have been saved
311 MM_OLDSRV The server is too old to save notes this long; the stored notes are unchanged
